OL,3,AWill the Lindsay Clancy trial end in a
OL,4,Amistrial? Here are the jury's options
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is desired that the case be
OL,7,Fdecided," Judge William Sullivan told
OL,8,Fthe panel on Wednesday afternoon, after
OL,9,Fmembers sent him a second note saying
OL,10,Fthey are undecided after five days.
OL,12,FHe read a mandatory, formal set of
OL,13,Finstructions and sent them back - some
OL,14,Fwith frustrated expressions on their
OL,15,Ffaces.
